</style><link rel="canonical" href="https://microlink.io/" data-baseprotocol="https:" data-basehost="microlink.io"/><link rel="sitemap" type="application/xml" href="/sitemap-index.xml"/><link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="Microlink Blog" href="/rss.xml"/><script async="" src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-4MN95ELTLZ" type="59a26039cba200b3f079147e-text/javascript"></script><script type="59a26039cba200b3f079147e-text/javascript">window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments)}
var consent='granted';try{if(localStorage.getItem('microlink-cookie-consent')==='denied')consent='denied'}catch(e){}
gtag('consent','default',{ad_storage:consent,ad_user_data:consent,ad_personalization:consent,analytics_storage:consent});
gtag('set','ads_data_redaction',consent==='denied');
gtag('js',new Date());
gtag('config','G-4MN95ELTLZ');</script><title data-gatsby-head="true">Microlink | The web, ready for AI</title><script type="application/ld+json" data-gatsby-head="true">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareApplication","name":"Microlink","alternateName":["Microlink.io","Microlink API","Microlink HQ"],"operatingSystem":"Any","applicationCategory":["DeveloperApplication","WebApplication"],"url":"https://microlink.io","image":"https://cdn.microlink.io/logo/logo.png","description":"A single API for turning any URL into data. Built for apps & agents. Powered by real browsers.","softwareHelp":"https://microlink.io/docs","offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"0","priceCurrency":"EUR"},"author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Microlink","url":"https://microlink.io"},"sameAs":["https://github.com/microlinkhq","https://x.com/microlinkhq"]}</script><script type="application/ld+json" data-gatsby-head="true">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://microlink.io/#faq","url":"https://microlink.io","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Microlink?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A single API that turns any URL into data: screenshots, PDFs, markdown, metadata, rendered HTML, search results, or the return value of your own browser code. You call an endpoint. We run the browsers, the cache, and the CDN behind it, so there is nothing to install or scale on your side."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use Microlink for free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Sign up for a free API key and you get 100 requests a month on every product, Search included, with every Pro feature and no credit card. See the endpoint docs. It has limits to prevent abuse: burst rate, concurrency, and the monthly quota. Enough for small projects and low-volume usage."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can my AI agent use Microlink?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Open Microlink AI and paste the prompt into your agent. It installs the Microlink skill, the entry point for screenshots, PDFs, markdown, and the rest of the API. The free API key covers every product, Search included; paid plans add volume."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s the difference between the free and paid plans?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Volume. The free API key already includes every feature, such as headers, ttl, proxy, and Search. Pro is built for production: a higher monthly quota and more concurrency on the same key. Not sure how much you need? Start with the smallest Pro tier and upgrade the moment you need more."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get an API key?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sign up at dashboard.microlink.io and you get a free API key, no credit card required. Paid plans add quota to the same account. Attach it to every request: In the Microlink SDK, as apiKey. In the Microlink API, as a header."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Microlink handle my traffic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The platform is built for production workloads and the bursty traffic agents generate: retries, loops, and parallel fan-outs. Our record for a single enterprise deployment is 188 million requests in one month, with more than 6 million requests a day sustained. No need to warn us before a spike or throttle on your side; your quota is the only limit."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How fast is it?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The first request renders the page in a real browser. Repeat it and the result comes back from the edge cache in milliseconds. Cache hits never count toward your quota, and the ttl parameter controls how fresh the response needs to be."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s your SLA level?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our SLA commitment is 99.9% uptime on every paid plan. You can see the live status of the service."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I change or cancel my plan?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Upgrade, downgrade, or cancel at any time from dashboard.microlink.io, no questions asked. We also notify you when you reach 80% of your quota, so you can move up before you hit the limit."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Other questions?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We’re always available at hello@microlink.io."}}]}</script><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:ital,wght@0,200;0,400;0,500;0,700;1,200;1,400;1,500;1,700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/><meta property="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes"/><meta property="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes"/><meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Microlink"/><meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="https://cdn.microlink.io/logo/favicon-96x96.png" sizes="96x96"/><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="https://cdn.microlink.io/logo/favicon.svg"/><link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://cdn.microlink.io/logo/favicon.ico"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="https://cdn.microlink.io/logo/apple-touch-icon.png"/><link rel="manifest" href="https://cdn.microlink.io/site.webmanifest"/></head><body><noscript id="gatsby-noscript">This app works best with JavaScript enabled.</noscript><div id="___gatsby"><div style="outline:none" tabindex="-1" id="gatsby-focus-wrapper"><a href="#main-content" class="Layout__SkipLinkAnchor-sc-1h463f-0 ftpVsD">Skip to content</a><div data-breakpoint="3" class="Box-sc-ev8b0j-0 Flex-sc-162cmzb-0 Layout__Root-sc-1h463f-1 lcKWbS guieOl"><div class="Box-sc-ev8b0j-0 Toolbar__MobileOnly-sc-1h0133c-0 gNsEvz"><header class="Box-sc-ev8b0j-0 ToolbarMobile__Header-sc-1si32v9-10 dKNlSQ"><nav aria-label="Mobile Navigation" class="ToolbarMobile___StyledToolbar-sc-1si32v9-13 dRyJGO"><div class="Box-sc-ev8b0j-0 Flex-sc-162cmzb-0 ToolbarMobile___StyledFlex2-sc-1si32v9-14 lcKWbS iMXbEx"><div class="Box-sc-ev8b0j-0 Text-sc-vva452-0 Caps-sc-1e6k1bg-0 NavLin